1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:02,210
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,580
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,340
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:12,920
(Episode 95)

5
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,820
So, let me ask you something.

6
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:24,200
Who are you to just show up
and start asking questions?

7
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,230
"I'll tell everyone
whose son you really are."

8
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:32,140
What did you mean by that?

9
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:36,810
Could it be...

10
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:42,480
that Park Hyun Jun
isn't Park Tae Ho's son?

11
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,120
Really?

12
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:51,390
Seriously? No way.

13
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:54,260
Did I just stumble onto a secret?

14
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:00,730
No way.

15
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:07,270
(Stock Transfer Agreement)

16
00:01:07,970 --> 00:01:10,070
Fortunately, she gave us her shares.

17
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:13,780
With Park Tae Ho arrested
and a solid stake secured,

18
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,380
we'll have the upper hand
at the shareholders' meeting.

19
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:22,350
It's a huge relief
that you brought this, but...

20
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,420
But what?

21
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:31,860
Come on. Why the long faces?
Did something happen?

22
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:36,200
We weren't able to get
Park Tae Ho's slush fund ledger.

23
00:01:37,270 --> 00:01:40,100
Park Tae Ho had Park Hyun Jun
sneak it away.

24
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:44,680
Are you saying
Hyun Jun has the slush fund ledger?

25
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:45,880
Yes.

26
00:01:46,410 --> 00:01:49,180
I think he's going to use it
to get Park Tae Ho out.

27
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:52,350
If Park Tae Ho gets out
without being arrested,

28
00:01:54,090 --> 00:01:56,990
who knows what he'll pull
before the shareholders' meeting.

29
00:01:57,820 --> 00:02:00,360
Then I'll go meet with Hyun Jun.

30
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:04,160
Do you think he'll just hand over
the slush fund ledger to us?

31
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,330
It might be difficult
to get the slush fund ledger,

32
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,030
but I'll try to convince him...

33
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:13,040
not to bail out Park Tae Ho
or obstruct the investigation.

34
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:15,010
Then I'll go with you.

35
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:26,620
I doubt persuasion will work on him.

36
00:02:27,390 --> 00:02:29,890
But we can't just give up
that easily.

37
00:02:30,690 --> 00:02:34,090
I have to find a way
to stop Park Tae Ho too.

38
00:02:34,230 --> 00:02:36,790
I'll double-check our deal
with Oh Jung Ran.

39
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:44,540
Goodness.

40
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:47,140
Spit it out.

41
00:02:47,810 --> 00:02:49,210
How much do you want?

42
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:54,010
Well, when it comes to money,
the more, the better, right?

43
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:57,150
Honestly, I...

44
00:02:57,650 --> 00:03:00,590
don't want to meddle
in other people's family secrets.

45
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:04,460
Since my police career was ruined,

46
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,560
I just want
to be compensated for it.

47
00:03:07,790 --> 00:03:08,790
So...

48
00:03:08,930 --> 00:03:11,160
Make me a real offer,
if you care about your son.

49
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,400
Just how much are you trying
to extort from us?

50
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:18,870
So,

51
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,670
you're saying you'll keep quiet
if we give you money?

52
00:03:22,610 --> 00:03:23,840
Exactly.

53
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:27,150
That's why I haven't bothered asking
who Park Hyun Jun's real father is.

54
00:03:29,850 --> 00:03:31,220
I hear...

55
00:03:31,950 --> 00:03:33,220
they're voting on...

56
00:03:33,450 --> 00:03:35,920
the next Adele Group chairman
at the shareholders' meeting.

57
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,260
Pay me as soon as possible,
prior to that.

58
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:44,200
If you're late, I'll go
to the shareholders' meeting...

59
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:48,330
and shout, "Park Hyun Jun
isn't Park Tae Ho's son!"

60
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:50,940
Loud and clear for everyone to hear.

61
00:03:52,670 --> 00:03:56,070
Come on.
Let's not let it come to that.

62
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:00,140
All right?

63
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,420
Choi Yu Na, you...

64
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,560
Why are you taking it out on me?

65
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,930
Because you're the one
who messed everything up.

66
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,830
Did I do it on purpose?

67
00:04:17,030 --> 00:04:18,700
How dare you raise your voice?

68
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,000
You lost the shares we had
to Baek Jin Ju,

69
00:04:21,170 --> 00:04:22,170
and jeopardized Hyun Jun's future...

70
00:04:22,230 --> 00:04:24,270
by getting a guy
like Deputy Chief Yun involved.

71
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,370
This is your mess, so clean it up.

72
00:04:27,970 --> 00:04:30,810
Get the money somehow
and shut Deputy Chief Yun up.

73
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,880
Fine.

74
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:33,850
I guess I'll just handle it myself.

75
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:36,710
How hard can it be
to shut one person up?

76
00:04:54,170 --> 00:04:55,630
Did they already make a move?

77
00:04:58,270 --> 00:05:00,100
The person you are calling...

78
00:05:06,210 --> 00:05:07,310
Yes, James.

79
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:08,850
I have news from the intel team.

80
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:11,680
Looks like Park Hyun Jun's
already meeting Assemblyman Kwon.

81
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,320
What, already?

82
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,390
Where are they meeting?

83
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:18,590
This is the first and last time.

84
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:20,660
If he ever threatens me
like this again,

85
00:05:20,730 --> 00:05:21,990
there will be consequences.

86
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:24,530
Go and make that crystal clear
to Park Tae Ho.

87
00:05:34,370 --> 00:05:35,440
Park Hyun Jun.

88
00:05:40,210 --> 00:05:42,180
Are you having me followed now?

89
00:05:43,110 --> 00:05:44,720
I'm glad I acted quickly.

90
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:48,150
I managed to wrap things up
before you interfered.

91
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:49,720
Did you really...

92
00:05:49,990 --> 00:05:52,260
leverage the slush fund ledger
to save Park Tae Ho?

93
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:55,890
By threatening and using the people
who were on his payroll?

94
00:05:55,930 --> 00:05:58,160
If I'm going to beat you
and become the chairman of Adele Group,

95
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,160
I couldn't...

96
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:02,230
just let my father get arrested.

97
00:06:07,370 --> 00:06:10,710
The slush fund ledger was proof
of the accident seven years ago.

98
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:12,510
It could've exposed
all of Park Tae Ho's crimes...

99
00:06:12,580 --> 00:06:14,280
and made sure he was punished.

100
00:06:14,650 --> 00:06:15,950
You knew all of that,

101
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:18,120
and you still misused it like this
for Park Tae Ho?

102
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:19,550
Are you actually...

103
00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:21,920
trying to turn into him?

104
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,760
I'm his son, aren't I?

105
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,490
Isn't it normal for me
to be just like him?

106
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,430
Hey, Park Hyun Jun.

107
00:06:42,570 --> 00:06:43,980
Park Hyun Jun...

108
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,340
I don't think we can reason
with him anymore.

109
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:50,250
Has he already become
just like Park Tae Ho?

110
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:02,760
Park Hyun Jun.

111
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,700
You did a great job.

112
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:09,870
You're finally acting
like my son should.

113
00:07:10,030 --> 00:07:12,700
Just because he got you out of jail,
now you're proud of him?

114
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:18,040
Bring the slush fund ledger
and come to my study.

115
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,080
Sure.

116
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,920
Good.

117
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,130
Nice job following orders.

118
00:07:34,790 --> 00:07:37,830
Are you putting the ledger back
in the P.O. box?

119
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:39,930
No.

120
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:44,270
I mean, after what just happened,

121
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,300
I've realized
it's just not worth the hassle.

122
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:49,040
Let's see.

123
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:53,810
Kim Dan Hui and Baek Jin Ju.
Those two.

124
00:07:55,250 --> 00:07:57,220
There's no telling
what they'll do next.

125
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:02,420
For now,
I'll keep it somewhere close.

126
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,700
If I get into trouble again,
pull out that ledger...

127
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,430
and use it to get me out.

128
00:08:13,730 --> 00:08:16,930
When you become chairman,
I'll give you the password,

129
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,670
so take good care of it.

130
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,400
Sure.

131
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,040
Father.

132
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:26,440
That's the spirit.

133
00:08:26,710 --> 00:08:29,380
How are the preparations
for the shareholders' meeting going?

134
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:32,880
Actually, the situation
doesn't look good.

135
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,450
The shares from Choi Yu Na's side,

136
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:36,520
have been transferred
to Baek Jin Ju.

137
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:38,990
What?

138
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:43,030
What on earth is Choi Yu Na doing?

139
00:08:48,570 --> 00:08:49,570
Well...

140
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:52,340
You said you were cutting ties.
Why are you here again?

141
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:55,810
Don't tell me...

142
00:08:56,140 --> 00:08:59,040
you got kicked out of their house
because you couldn't get the shares.

143
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:00,910
What gives?

144
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:03,150
You gave all your shares
to Baek Jin Ju,

145
00:09:03,410 --> 00:09:04,820
and now you're worried about me?

146
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,220
Did you really get kicked out?

147
00:09:08,050 --> 00:09:10,860
Oh my.
It's for the best then, isn't it?

148
00:09:11,390 --> 00:09:12,460
Yu Na.

149
00:09:12,620 --> 00:09:15,230
You can come back
and live with me again.

150
00:09:15,530 --> 00:09:16,530
Take a look around.

151
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:18,700
Jin Ju took care
of all those foreclosure notices...

152
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:20,700
that were posted here.

153
00:09:21,830 --> 00:09:23,500
With the money Jin Ju gave me
for those shares,

154
00:09:23,570 --> 00:09:26,970
we'll never have to worry
about money again.

155
00:09:27,810 --> 00:09:29,070
Where's that money?

156
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:31,410
Where else? In the bank, of course.

157
00:09:31,710 --> 00:09:33,380
Then go to the bank right now.

158
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:35,950
Since you didn't give me the shares,
at least give me the money.

159
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,720
Are you crazy?

160
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:39,520
Don't be ridiculous.

161
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:42,150
That money is all
I have to rely on now.

162
00:09:42,450 --> 00:09:44,490
That money is all
I have to rely on too.

163
00:09:44,890 --> 00:09:47,020
There's something I need to handle
with that money.

164
00:09:47,690 --> 00:09:49,090
Go get the money now.

165
00:09:49,190 --> 00:09:50,930
- What's gotten into you?
- Hurry!

166
00:09:50,930 --> 00:09:53,700
You brat. No need to drag me.
Just hold on.

167
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:58,270
(Team Leader Choi Yu Na)

168
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,340
Darn it.

169
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,440
Unbelievable.

170
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:08,810
Why isn't Choi Yu Na
answering her phone?

171
00:10:09,450 --> 00:10:11,950
After she lost all her shares
to Baek Jin Ju,

172
00:10:12,450 --> 00:10:14,920
why hasn't she even reported it?
That brat!

173
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,520
I wonder if Choi Yu Na
will get the money.

174
00:10:19,490 --> 00:10:22,190
Can I really trust her
to silence Deputy Chief Yun?

175
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:26,530
He has to be handled
before the shareholders' meeting.

176
00:10:27,130 --> 00:10:29,600
If Park Tae Ho finds out
about this...

177
00:10:30,770 --> 00:10:32,240
Do you want to lose your fingers?

178
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,540
What? What did you say?

179
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:35,770
That's disgusting.

180
00:10:36,170 --> 00:10:38,040
Look at where your hand is!

181
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,720
Honestly, where's your head at?

182
00:10:45,180 --> 00:10:48,750
I turn my back for a few days
and everything falls apart?

183
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,920
The state of the house...

184
00:10:50,990 --> 00:10:52,690
and even the preparations
for the shareholders' meeting...

185
00:10:53,290 --> 00:10:55,260
Everything's a complete mess.

186
00:10:55,590 --> 00:10:58,500
Well, after you were arrested
by the police,

187
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,900
I was so out of it...

188
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:01,900
Whatever.

189
00:11:02,130 --> 00:11:04,200
What have you found out
about Moon Tae Jin so far?

190
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,540
About that...

191
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:07,740
I've been busy
with something more urgent.

192
00:11:07,810 --> 00:11:10,980
What could possibly be
more important and urgent than this?

193
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,180
The shareholders' meeting
is right around the corner,

194
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,210
and Choi Yu Na lost her shares.

195
00:11:15,310 --> 00:11:16,950
And you, Oh Jung Ran,

196
00:11:17,010 --> 00:11:19,120
don't even know anything
about the major shareholder.

197
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,920
What is wrong with you two?

198
00:11:21,450 --> 00:11:24,190
Do I have to do everything
around here?

199
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,860
There's also Park Min Jun.

200
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:29,160
Why is he still at the company?

201
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:33,430
Who knows what he'll pull
before the shareholders' meeting?

202
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:36,630
Get rid of him now. Honestly.

203
00:11:37,370 --> 00:11:39,240
You and your long list of demands.

204
00:11:43,810 --> 00:11:46,540
And one more thing.

205
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:48,210
Deputy Chief Yun.

206
00:11:49,110 --> 00:11:51,750
Deputy Chief Yun? What about him?

207
00:11:52,350 --> 00:11:56,190
Hasn't he come to you
demanding money?

208
00:11:56,490 --> 00:11:57,560
No.

209
00:11:58,060 --> 00:12:00,930
- Why?
- If he does, ignore him.

210
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:05,300
He'll be kicked off the force soon.
He's no longer of any use.

211
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,130
But...

212
00:12:07,930 --> 00:12:10,700
Deputy Chief Yun
knows about all your crimes.

213
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:13,500
Wouldn't it be better
to just come up with the money?

214
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:16,740
If you give him what he wants,
there'll be no end to his demands.

215
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,980
It's best to stall him
until the shareholders' meeting,

216
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:22,110
and then get rid of him.

217
00:12:22,310 --> 00:12:23,580
Get rid of him?

218
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:27,280
Are you planning to kill him too?

219
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:30,550
He actually dared
to throw a punch...

220
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,520
at Park Tae Ho.

221
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:36,490
He's so blinded by money
that he's resorting to blackmail.

222
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,330
A guy like that isn't going
to live long.

223
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:46,170
Get rid of Deputy Chief Yun?

224
00:12:51,740 --> 00:12:53,210
What does she want now?

225
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:57,380
What now?

226
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:05,160
Why did you call me back
after I had already gone home?

227
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:07,890
Are you taking it out on me
because Park Tae Ho was released?

228
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,100
Park Tae Ho's slush fund ledger.

229
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:13,660
Now that it's out in the open,

230
00:13:13,930 --> 00:13:16,500
we need to renegotiate our deal.

231
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:18,840
The slush fund ledger?

232
00:13:19,300 --> 00:13:20,300
That's right.

233
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:22,740
Before the shareholders' meeting,

234
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:24,510
bring me the slush fund ledger.

235
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:26,380
Otherwise,

236
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,680
I'll reveal Hyun Jun's secret...

237
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,310
- at the shareholders' meeting.
- Hey.

238
00:13:30,310 --> 00:13:33,250
I've been very patient up until now.

239
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:37,250
I only held back out of fear
that Min Jun would get hurt,

240
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,120
and because all those years...

241
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:43,530
fighting with you over Park Tae Ho
just felt so pointless.

242
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,930
I also held back...

243
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:48,900
because Min Jun and Jin Ju
were worried about Hyun Jun.

244
00:13:50,430 --> 00:13:51,440
But...

245
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,540
I don't think
I can hold back any longer.

246
00:13:55,310 --> 00:13:57,810
So you're really determined
to ruin Hyun Jun's life?

247
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,510
Isn't Hyun Jun...

248
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:02,010
already on the path to ruin?

249
00:14:04,350 --> 00:14:08,190
He at least used to know
right from wrong,

250
00:14:09,190 --> 00:14:13,320
and he was ashamed of your
and Park Tae Ho's evil deeds.

251
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:16,560
But now he's siding
with Park Tae Ho...

252
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:19,230
and making the exact same choices.

253
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:23,470
If this continues,
Hyun Jun's life...

254
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:25,370
will be completely ruined.

255
00:14:25,370 --> 00:14:29,510
No, the ones ruining Hyun Jun's life
are you and Baek Jin Ju.

256
00:14:30,310 --> 00:14:33,880
Besides, this deal
had unfair terms from the beginning.

257
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,480
Finding the slush fund ledger...

258
00:14:36,550 --> 00:14:38,620
wouldn't get us
the chairmanship anyway.

259
00:14:38,950 --> 00:14:40,820
You expect me to hand it over...

260
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,390
just to shut you up?

261
00:14:42,650 --> 00:14:45,760
When I stand to lose both the ledger
and the chairmanship?

262
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:48,390
If you want the ledger,

263
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,930
promise me you'll give up
the chairmanship first.

264
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,030
No.

265
00:14:54,330 --> 00:14:56,030
My terms haven't changed.

266
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,700
Neither have mine.

267
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:00,270
Unless you give up the chairmanship,

268
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,470
you won't get the slush fund ledger.

269
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,210
If you don't bring
the slush fund ledger...

270
00:15:10,450 --> 00:15:12,650
before the shareholders' meeting,

271
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:15,820
I'll reveal Hyun Jun's secret.

272
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:19,060
So think carefully.

273
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,870
First Deputy Chief Yun,
and now Kim Dan Hui.

274
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:33,670
Why is everything blowing up
all at once?

275
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,510
I just need to get through
the shareholders' meeting.

276
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:38,480
I can't let them get in my way.

277
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:42,180
Whatever it takes, I'll protect...

278
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:44,580
Hyun Jun's future.

279
00:15:56,090 --> 00:15:57,590
Park Hyun Jun.

280
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,630
Just how far are you
going to take this?

281
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:05,840
This is all my fault.

282
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:09,840
Did I do this to you?

283
00:16:20,050 --> 00:16:21,190
Yes, Ms. Hong.

284
00:16:22,490 --> 00:16:25,690
What? Choi Yu Na
took the money I gave you?

285
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:28,130
What does she need the money for?

286
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,530
Just stay put. I'll look into it.

287
00:16:36,330 --> 00:16:37,600
James, it's me.

288
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:40,640
Can you ask the intel team
to track down Choi Yu Na for me?

289
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,310
I think she's up to something again.

290
00:17:00,990 --> 00:17:03,330
By the way,
why are you paying to keep...

291
00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:04,800
Park Hyun Jun's secret hidden?

292
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,560
Is it because
you let the secret slip to me?

293
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:11,800
Or are you two that close?

294
00:17:11,870 --> 00:17:14,270
That's right. We are.

295
00:17:15,270 --> 00:17:16,740
We're getting married.

296
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:21,250
I need to make
Park Hyun Jun the chairman,

297
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:22,910
so I can take over Adele Group.

298
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:28,450
Just take money
and keep your mouth shut.

299
00:17:28,450 --> 00:17:29,750
Of course.

300
00:17:30,850 --> 00:17:32,190
That I should.

301
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:35,860
I also want Park Hyun Jun
to become Adele's new chairman.

302
00:17:36,230 --> 00:17:39,000
That way, you can bring me
bags of money like this...

303
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,130
anytime I ask.

304
00:17:41,470 --> 00:17:43,970
What? Anytime you ask?

305
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:45,140
What did you expect?

306
00:17:45,140 --> 00:17:47,170
Did you really think
this would be the end of it?

307
00:17:47,470 --> 00:17:50,170
When Park Hyun Jun becomes chairman,

308
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:53,080
I'll be the one who knows
the Adele Group chairman's secret.

309
00:17:54,610 --> 00:17:55,980
What do you mean by that?

310
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:57,350
What the...

311
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:01,450
Did you just say
you know Hyun Jun's secret?

312
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:08,860
Choi Yu Na.

313
00:18:09,490 --> 00:18:11,260
Is he the reason
you took that money?

314
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:13,030
And you.

315
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:15,670
What are you planning to do
with Hyun Jun's secret?

316
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:17,630
Isn't it obvious?

317
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:20,100
In exchange for my silence,

318
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:22,410
I'm getting a nice payout.

319
00:18:23,210 --> 00:18:26,040
Well, I've said my piece.
I'll be going.

320
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:30,750
If you use that secret
to mess with Park Hyun Jun,

321
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:32,450
you'll have me to answer to.

322
00:18:35,290 --> 00:18:36,450
Anyone seeing this...

323
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:39,420
would think
you're Park Hyun Jun's wife.

324
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:43,730
Oh, right. You two were married.
Of course.

325
00:18:44,930 --> 00:18:47,130
Park Hyun Jun, look at you.

326
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:49,470
Two women covering your back?

327
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,370
Must be nice.

328
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:57,880
Why are you sticking your nose in?

329
00:18:57,880 --> 00:19:00,840
How did he find out
about Hyun Jun's secret?

330
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:05,480
You're not his wife,
so why do you care?

331
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:08,390
I'll handle this, so stay out of it.

332
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:10,890
If your solution is
to throw money at him,

333
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:12,590
it won't last long.

334
00:19:13,390 --> 00:19:16,760
He'll never stop threatening you
and making demands.

335
00:19:16,930 --> 00:19:19,400
Find another way
before it's too late.

336
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:21,700
Wait.

337
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:27,600
What's your deal?

338
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,940
You know all about
Hyun Jun's secret.

339
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,510
Why haven't you exposed it?

340
00:19:31,910 --> 00:19:33,340
Had you revealed it
at the board meeting,

341
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,580
it would've been game over.

342
00:19:35,050 --> 00:19:36,150
Don't tell me...

343
00:19:36,780 --> 00:19:39,180
you're waiting to reveal it
at the shareholders' meeting.

344
00:19:39,450 --> 00:19:41,620
I suggest you mind
your own business too.

345
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,600
Yes, Director Seo.

346
00:19:53,300 --> 00:19:57,000
Is there anyone on the board
who knows Moon Tae Jin?

347
00:19:57,470 --> 00:20:00,670
Yes, I should meet her in person
before the shareholders' meeting.

348
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:06,610
What on earth was she thinking,
getting a job at my house?

349
00:20:06,780 --> 00:20:09,350
And why is she taking
Kim Dan Hui's side?

350
00:20:09,410 --> 00:20:10,480
I have to find out.

351
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:14,590
That's right.
Where can I find Moon Tae Jin?

352
00:20:15,290 --> 00:20:17,450
What? Ihwachae?

353
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,490
Again?

354
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:23,090
Butler Ok.

355
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:27,700
What are you doing here?

356
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:33,340
I heard a rumor
that Butler Ok was here.

357
00:20:33,700 --> 00:20:35,410
Kim Dan Hui, and now Butler Ok.

358
00:20:36,570 --> 00:20:38,910
So, is this where
all the witches gather?

359
00:20:39,010 --> 00:20:42,980
Of course.
It takes a beast to see another.

360
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:44,280
A beast?

361
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:47,250
Just because you own
some Adele Group stock,

362
00:20:47,320 --> 00:20:48,850
you think you're above it all?

363
00:20:49,650 --> 00:20:50,790
Give it to me straight.

364
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:54,120
What were you and Kim Dan Hui
plotting here?

365
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:56,890
What were you scheming
when you took a job at my house?

366
00:20:57,590 --> 00:21:00,260
Are you planning to stab me
in the back...

367
00:21:00,930 --> 00:21:02,330
at the shareholders' meeting?

368
00:21:02,630 --> 00:21:06,040
That's right.
I've been planning to destroy you...

369
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,870
for a very long time.

370
00:21:08,510 --> 00:21:12,010
You ungrateful thief
who stole Munhwadang!

371
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:15,750
Wait, what?

372
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:18,420
- Munhwadang?
- That's right.

373
00:21:18,950 --> 00:21:20,750
For Mr. Moon Hyeon Bo,

374
00:21:21,350 --> 00:21:24,120
we'll take back
the stolen Munhwadang.

375
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:28,660
Hold on. What are you talking about?

376
00:21:28,730 --> 00:21:31,500
For my uncle,
who died an unjust death,

377
00:21:31,560 --> 00:21:34,030
I've prepared for the day
I'd destroy you.

378
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:35,900
Uncle?

379
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:39,370
Moon Tae Jin and Moon Hyeon Bo.

380
00:21:41,810 --> 00:21:44,240
- So you're with Munhwadang?
- That's right.

381
00:21:44,810 --> 00:21:47,640
Just as you stole Munhwadang,

382
00:21:48,110 --> 00:21:50,580
we're going to steal
the Adele Group from you,

383
00:21:50,650 --> 00:21:51,720
so be ready!

384
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:57,350
Come on.
The Munhwadang thing was ages ago.

385
00:21:58,190 --> 00:22:03,160
You've been holding onto that grudge
all these years just for revenge?

386
00:22:03,430 --> 00:22:04,860
You infiltrated my house...

387
00:22:06,230 --> 00:22:07,500
just to target me?

388
00:22:08,370 --> 00:22:11,330
Your sins won't just follow you
for decades.

389
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,270
They'll haunt you for hundreds,

390
00:22:13,500 --> 00:22:16,170
even thousands of years
until you pay the price.

391
00:22:17,540 --> 00:22:20,780
Fine.
Come at me with all you've got.

392
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:23,050
I'll just shake you off every time,

393
00:22:24,050 --> 00:22:26,080
crushing and squashing your efforts.

394
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:30,420
That goes for you two,
Kim Dan Hui, and Baek Jin Ju.

395
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:33,520
No one is taking Adele Group...

396
00:22:33,620 --> 00:22:35,260
away from me.

397
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:03,050
That darn Munhwadang.

398
00:23:05,390 --> 00:23:09,130
That old man's niece was
in this house for over a decade,

399
00:23:10,490 --> 00:23:13,130
right under my nose
without my knowledge,

400
00:23:13,260 --> 00:23:15,200
collecting shares...

401
00:23:16,670 --> 00:23:20,440
and slowly taking over Adele Group.

402
00:23:22,610 --> 00:23:26,080
And now she's dragged in
Kim Dan Hui and Baek Jin Ju...

403
00:23:27,380 --> 00:23:29,380
to take it from me openly?

404
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,520
No way.

405
00:23:42,090 --> 00:23:44,830
No, I will never lose
the Adele Group.

406
00:23:45,260 --> 00:23:47,030
Even if I have to wipe them all out,

407
00:23:48,830 --> 00:23:50,100
I'm not losing my company.

408
00:24:11,990 --> 00:24:14,760
Park Tae Ho must've given you
quite a shock.

409
00:24:15,690 --> 00:24:16,690
Not at all.

410
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:18,430
When you're dealing
with Park Tae Ho,

411
00:24:18,860 --> 00:24:20,860
there's no reason
to be surprised or afraid.

412
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:24,600
If anything, he was probably the one
who was more flustered.

413
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:27,970
Still, I wish
we had kept it a secret...

414
00:24:28,370 --> 00:24:30,370
that we're from Munhwadang.

415
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,980
To avoid losing Adele Group,

416
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:35,780
I'm worried he'll become
even more desperate.

417
00:24:36,150 --> 00:24:37,610
Don't worry too much.

418
00:24:37,950 --> 00:24:39,580
The shareholders' meeting is
in a few days,

419
00:24:40,020 --> 00:24:41,720
and we've secured more shares.

420
00:24:42,850 --> 00:24:46,760
But Park Tae Ho still holds
the most shares.

421
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:50,730
That's why I came up with a way
to render his shares useless.

422
00:24:51,190 --> 00:24:52,760
What do you mean by that?

423
00:24:53,930 --> 00:24:55,430
I'm planning on revoking...

424
00:24:56,130 --> 00:24:58,740
Park Tae Ho's voting rights.

425
00:25:00,670 --> 00:25:03,670
I believe we have a shot
if we file a court petition.

426
00:25:03,970 --> 00:25:04,980
I see.

427
00:25:05,910 --> 00:25:09,380
You mean filing for an injunction
to block his voting rights?

428
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,980
That's right.

429
00:25:12,450 --> 00:25:15,690
If we file an emergency motion
behind Park Tae Ho's back...

430
00:25:15,790 --> 00:25:16,790
Exactly.

431
00:25:17,020 --> 00:25:20,160
He won't realize until right before
the shareholders' meeting...

432
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:21,420
that his hands are tied.

433
00:25:21,860 --> 00:25:23,730
Then Jin Ju...

434
00:25:24,130 --> 00:25:26,160
will become the chairman
of Adele Group.

435
00:25:36,010 --> 00:25:39,240
(Adele)

436
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,850
So, in the end...

437
00:25:51,550 --> 00:25:53,460
But it's not over yet.

438
00:25:54,260 --> 00:25:56,230
Tomorrow,
after the shareholders' meeting,

439
00:25:56,290 --> 00:25:57,660
once Jin Ju becomes chairman,

440
00:26:00,700 --> 00:26:01,830
I'll be back.

441
00:26:09,940 --> 00:26:11,010
Looks like you got fired.

442
00:26:12,540 --> 00:26:16,510
The moment the chairman got out,
he started cleaning house.

443
00:26:16,750 --> 00:26:18,210
Your time is almost up too.

444
00:26:19,850 --> 00:26:22,190
You turned your father
into a murderer for him,

445
00:26:22,320 --> 00:26:25,790
and no matter how much dirty work
you do for Park Tae Ho,

446
00:26:26,820 --> 00:26:29,930
he'll toss you aside
the moment you're useless.

447
00:26:32,900 --> 00:26:34,600
About Baek Jin Ju.

448
00:26:40,470 --> 00:26:41,970
Why did she do that
at the board meeting?

449
00:26:42,670 --> 00:26:44,770
She knows
about Park Hyun Jun's secret,

450
00:26:45,410 --> 00:26:46,510
so why didn't she reveal it?

451
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:50,980
She's probably waiting
for the perfect moment.

452
00:26:58,660 --> 00:26:59,920
The perfect moment?

453
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:03,860
Is she really going to reveal it
at the shareholders' meeting?

454
00:27:11,470 --> 00:27:12,640
He wants more money?

455
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:17,070
How much did you give him, peanuts?

456
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:19,480
It wouldn't have mattered
how much I paid him.

457
00:27:19,580 --> 00:27:21,340
He intends to bleed us dry for life.

458
00:27:21,510 --> 00:27:22,880
That crazy little...

459
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:24,980
But we're so close.

460
00:27:26,180 --> 00:27:29,390
Why does all this crap
have to get in my son's way?

461
00:27:29,890 --> 00:27:31,820
First Kim Dan Hui,
and now Deputy Chief Yun.

462
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:33,790
They're hanging my son's secret
over my head.

463
00:27:35,190 --> 00:27:36,460
I won't let them get away with this.

464
00:27:37,260 --> 00:27:38,260
Exactly.

465
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:41,100
We can't let them have their way.

466
00:27:42,770 --> 00:27:43,770
What?

467
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:46,800
Deputy Chief Yun is a problem,

468
00:27:46,940 --> 00:27:48,300
but if Kim Dan Hui
and Baek Jin Ju...

469
00:27:48,300 --> 00:27:50,110
reveal the secret
at the shareholders' meeting,

470
00:27:50,410 --> 00:27:52,910
it's game over no matter
how many shares the chairman has.

471
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,750
So?

472
00:27:56,980 --> 00:27:58,750
Don't tell me you're open
to shedding blood too.

473
00:27:59,980 --> 00:28:03,550
I knew we'd be on the same page.

474
00:28:07,290 --> 00:28:08,290
Choi Yu Na!

475
00:28:11,230 --> 00:28:13,530
How dare you ignore my calls?

476
00:28:14,530 --> 00:28:17,170
You let Baek Jin Ju take the shares
I told you to bring,

477
00:28:17,230 --> 00:28:18,270
and you didn't even report it?

478
00:28:18,500 --> 00:28:21,240
I had something urgent
to take care of.

479
00:28:21,270 --> 00:28:24,710
What could be more urgent
than the shareholders' meeting?

480
00:28:25,340 --> 00:28:27,340
I was also preparing
for the shareholders' meeting.

481
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:30,880
I can't lose to Baek Jin Ju,
so I was busy trying to find a way.

482
00:28:32,450 --> 00:28:34,580
Like you'd actually have
a good plan.

483
00:28:34,580 --> 00:28:35,590
Actually,

484
00:28:36,050 --> 00:28:37,920
I have a pretty good idea.

485
00:28:39,320 --> 00:28:40,660
If we use Deputy Chief Yun,

486
00:28:41,060 --> 00:28:43,560
we can win
at the shareholders' meeting.

487
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:58,440
Park Tae Ho still holds
the largest stake...

488
00:28:58,510 --> 00:28:59,510
in the Adele Group.

489
00:29:00,410 --> 00:29:01,640
What's our total combined stake?

490
00:29:02,310 --> 00:29:04,980
Between my shares,
the ones we got from Choi Yu Na,

491
00:29:04,980 --> 00:29:07,080
Moon Tae Jin's,

492
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:10,250
and the rest of our friendly shares,

493
00:29:10,690 --> 00:29:12,260
ours almost match Park Tae Ho's.

494
00:29:13,090 --> 00:29:14,190
In that case,

495
00:29:14,760 --> 00:29:17,230
if we can just block
Park Tae Ho's voting rights...

496
00:29:17,860 --> 00:29:19,230
We win...

497
00:29:19,930 --> 00:29:20,930
for sure.

498
00:29:24,800 --> 00:29:27,240
I've scheduled a meeting
with Deputy Chief Yun.

499
00:29:30,610 --> 00:29:33,440
You didn't leave any traces,
like call records, did you?

500
00:29:34,110 --> 00:29:36,880
Of course.
I called him from a burner phone.

501
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,180
What about Oh Jung Ran?

502
00:29:39,180 --> 00:29:41,020
She's proceeding according to plan.

503
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:44,790
Since everything looks ready,

504
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:46,160
shall we get started?

505
00:29:55,870 --> 00:29:58,500
Why did you suddenly ask to see me?

506
00:30:00,500 --> 00:30:01,800
Come to think of it,

507
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:04,910
I met you as Chloe, and you
turned out to be Baek Jin Ju,

508
00:30:05,510 --> 00:30:07,780
and I never got to properly
confront you about it.

509
00:30:08,140 --> 00:30:10,510
How dare you deceive
and use my Hyun Jun?

510
00:30:10,710 --> 00:30:14,650
Hyun Jun was the first to know
that I was Baek Jin Ju.

511
00:30:15,490 --> 00:30:17,250
After he found out everything
that happened seven years ago,

512
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:19,120
he said he'd help me get my revenge.

513
00:30:19,620 --> 00:30:24,190
Right. My soft-hearted Hyun Jun
was probably just blinded by love.

514
00:30:24,690 --> 00:30:27,660
And yet, you threw my Hyun Jun away.

515
00:30:28,300 --> 00:30:31,470
You ruined his future
to make yourself Adele's chairman,

516
00:30:31,870 --> 00:30:34,100
and now you want to expose him
at the shareholders' meeting?

517
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:37,410
I don't want to use
Hyun Jun's secret against him.

518
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:39,880
How dare you lie to my face?

519
00:30:40,210 --> 00:30:43,210
Kim Dan Hui just threatened
to expose it at the meeting.

520
00:30:43,580 --> 00:30:45,450
If you feel guilty
about using my son,

521
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:47,720
then get Kim Dan Hui to stay quiet.

522
00:30:48,380 --> 00:30:50,850
Whoever threatens us
with Hyun Jun's secret...

523
00:30:51,450 --> 00:30:53,420
will pay with their life.

524
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:55,020
Mark my words.

525
00:31:26,320 --> 00:31:29,030
Help... Help me.

526
00:32:09,930 --> 00:32:12,840
(Pearl in Red)

527
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,940
You'll deeply regret this today.

528
00:32:15,070 --> 00:32:16,610
For setting a trap for me...

529
00:32:16,770 --> 00:32:19,980
and throwing me in a cell,
I'll make you pay.

530
00:32:20,080 --> 00:32:22,450
Just you watch.
I'll make sure that Park Hyun Jun...

531
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,910
never becomes chairman.

532
00:32:24,180 --> 00:32:25,180
We'll see.

533
00:32:25,580 --> 00:32:27,450
I'm pretty sure
you'll be needing my help.

534
00:32:27,450 --> 00:32:29,790
- What are you talking about?
- Just wait.

535
00:32:29,790 --> 00:32:31,550
You'll find out soon enough.

536
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:34,320
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
